{"title":"Career Roadmap — Fibre Optics Engineer","role":"Fibre Optics Engineer","summary":"A Fibre Optics Engineer designs, deploys, tests, troubleshoots, and optimizes optical-fibre communication systems. The role combines optics, photonics, telecommunications, networking, fibre transmission, optical components, testing, and network engineering.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Optoelectronics / Photonics Engineering"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Fibre Optics Engineer designs, deploys, tests, troubleshoots, and optimizes optical-fibre communication systems. The role combines optics, photonics, telecommunications, networking, fibre transmission, optical components, testing, and network engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fibre network design"},{"text":"Optical link-budget analysis"},{"text":"Fibre installation and commissioning"},{"text":"OTDR testing"},{"text":"Optical power measurements"},{"text":"Splicing and termination"},{"text":"Fault localization"},{"text":"Optical network troubleshooting"},{"text":"PON/FTTH deployment"},{"text":"Data-center fibre infrastructure"},{"text":"Long-haul and metro optical networks"},{"text":"Optical transmission system optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong career path for students interested in the intersection of physics + electronics + telecommunications + networking."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech Photonics/Optoelectronics"},{"text":"Optics + fibre + communication fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Fibre Optics / Optical Network Engineer"},{"text":"Installation + testing + troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Fibre Optics Engineer"},{"text":"Network design + optical en